<details data-tool-requirements <?=($_POST['project_type']??'')==='research_tool'?'open':''?>><summary>Research tool requirements</summary><p>Required for tool projects. Define a small tool others can build and independently test. Source and tests use AGPL-3.0; research text uses CC BY 4.0. Files stay with the project; no repository is needed.</p><?php foreach(RT_FIELDS as $key=>$label)field($label,'tool_'.$key,(string)($_POST['tool_'.$key]??''),'textarea'); ?><p class="fine">The validation plan should include source-derived reference cases, boundaries, invalid inputs, units and justified numeric tolerances. If no maintainer is committed, explicitly describe the tool as experimental and unmaintained.</p></details>
<details><summary>External tools &amp; calculation help</summary><p>Describe what a volunteer needs before starting. Free software may still require license eligibility or paid computing.</p><?php select_field('Calculation help needed','calculation_help',EXTERNAL_HELP,$_POST['calculation_help']??'unspecified'); select_field('External tool access','external_tools',EXTERNAL_ACCESS,$_POST['external_tools']??'unspecified'); foreach(EXTERNAL_TEXT as $key=>$label)field($label,$key,(string)($_POST[$key]??''),'textarea'); ?><p class="fine">Include versions, license eligibility, existing access, CPU/GPU, RAM, storage, runtime and budget where known. Agents will ask permission to use computer use for downloads and setup, then verify installation. Do not include passwords or license keys.</p></details>
<details><summary>AI model &amp; reasoning requirements (optional)</summary><?php include __DIR__.'/ai-requirements.php'; ?></details>
<details><summary>Background, objectives & references</summary><?php foreach(['context'=>'Background and context','success'=>'Desired outcome or success criteria','previous'=>'Previous research','constraints_text'=>'Limitations or constraints','questions'=>'Specific questions','references_text'=>'References and source URLs','tags'=>'Tags, separated by commas'] as $key=>$label) field($label,$key,'',$key==='tags'?'text':'textarea'); ?></details>
<details><summary>Supporting files</summary><p class="fine">PDF, TXT, MD, PNG, JPEG. Up to <?=e(setting('max_file_mb','10'))?> MB each; <?=e(setting('max_total_mb','25'))?> MB total. No active content. Files require separate approval.</p><label for="attachments">Attachments</label><input id="attachments" type="file" name="attachments[]" multiple accept=".pdf,.txt,.md,.png,.jpg,.jpeg"></details>
<details><summary>Optional attribution & private email</summary><?php author_fields(); field('Private email for your link and request-related notices','email','','email'); ?><p class="fine">Email stays private. Attribution and profile links become public if approved. Identity is not verified.</p></details>
